# ~/.config/1Password symlinks to this directory, so the running app writes its
# live state here: sqlite DBs and their -shm/-wal siblings, Electron caches,
# window geometry, trust tokens. None of that belongs in version control.
#
# Deny everything, then allow back only what we actually want versioned.
# `ssh/` must be un-ignored before `ssh/agent.toml`: git will not descend into
# an excluded directory, so a bare `!ssh/agent.toml` would never match.
*
!.gitignore
!ssh/
!ssh/agent.toml
